{
    "title": "Cleanup Your Phone",
    "description": "To clean up your phone\u2019s storage and free up storage space, the first step is to locate large files that are taking up valuable space. Typically videos and photos take up alot of space. \r\nThat's where Cleanup comes in. With over 10 million downloads, this phone cleaning tool can help you quickly delete large videos and photos that you no longer need.\r\n\r\nCleanup is an easy-to-use and powerful app that can scan your phone's videos and photos for files over 10MB and help you delete them with just one tap. By doing this, you can clean up your phone and instantly save precious storage space.\r\n\r\nBy regularly using Cleanup to clear up your phone and remove unnecessary files, you can keep your device clean and avoid running out of space for your important files and apps.",
